diagram loopEngineering "Loop engineering: one agent, one sequential context"
viewport 202x72
theme midnight
direction right

text subtitle "A concrete feature task moves through planning, implementation, verification, and retry in a single context window" at 30,2 kind dim

node input "INPUT\n\nfeature request\nacceptance criteria\nrepo constraints" at 1,25 size 20x10 kind input
node phase "active task" at 3,37 size 16x3 kind phase

group cycle "single-agent task loop" at 24,5 size 134x56 kind repeat dashed

group planning "1 · plan" at 27,7 size 34x22 kind group in cycle
node planner "Planner agent\n\nread request\ninspect codebase\nidentify risks" at 32,11 size 23x9 kind agent in planning
node plan "WORK PLAN\nfiles • steps\nverification contract" at 31,22 size 25x5 kind output in planning

group building "2 · implement" at 64,7 size 43x22 kind group in cycle
node developer "Developer agent\n\nedit scoped files\nkeep invariants\nrecord decisions" at 68,11 size 22x9 kind agent in building
node tools "TOOLS\nsearch\nedit\nbuild" at 94,11 size 10x9 kind shell in building
node patch "PATCH\ncode + tests" at 76,23 size 18x4 kind output in building

group verifying "3 · verify" at 110,7 size 44x43 kind group in cycle
node reviewer "Verification agent\n\nreview diff\ncheck contract\nchallenge assumptions" at 114,11 size 23x9 kind reviewer in verifying
node checks "EVIDENCE\nunit tests\nlint / build\nUI screenshot" at 140,11 size 11x10 kind activity in verifying
node evidence "REPORT\nlogs • citations" at 135,24 size 18x5 kind output in verifying
decision pass "Pass?" at 123,32 size 15x7 in verifying
node findings "FINDINGS\nseverity • file\nrequired fix" at 113,43 size 20x5 kind failure in verifying

node context "SHARED CONTEXT\nplan • patch • logs\nfindings accumulate" at 68,37 size 26x7 kind activity in cycle
node queue "WAITING\nindependent tasks\ncannot start until\nthis loop releases" at 31,46 size 25x8 kind shell in cycle

node checkpoint "Checkpoint\ncommit artifact\nadvance queue" at 162,26 size 18x7 kind success
node output "OUTPUT\n\nverified patch\nevidence report" at 184,26 size 17x8 kind output

edge receive input -> phase from_port south to_port north
edge start phase -> planner from_port east to_port west via 22,38 22,15
edge plan_artifact planner -> plan from_port south to_port north
edge handoff plan -> developer from_port east to_port west via 62,24 62,15
edge use_tools developer -> tools from_port east to_port west
edge produce_patch tools -> patch from_port south to_port east via 99,25
edge patch_review patch -> reviewer from_port east to_port west via 108,25 108,15
edge review_checks reviewer -> checks from_port east to_port west
edge checks_evidence checks -> evidence from_port south to_port north
edge evidence_gate evidence -> pass from_port west to_port north via 130,26
edge rejected pass -> findings kind failure label "NO" from_port south to_port north
edge retry findings -> developer kind back label "fix + rerun" from_port west to_port south via 108,46 108,57 79,57 79,20
edge accepted pass -> checkpoint kind success label "YES" from_port east to_port west via 157,35 157,29
edge publish checkpoint -> output kind success from_port east to_port west
edge context_patch patch -> context kind muted from_port south to_port north
edge waiting input -> queue kind muted from_port east to_port west via 22,30 22,50

group metrics "" at 1,64 size 200x7 kind panel
text agentsTitle "Loop cost and behavior" at 90,64 kind title
text icon1 "♙" at 5,67 kind metric
text metric1 "Concurrency: 1 active agent\nper stage" at 11,66 kind plain
text separator1 "│\n│\n│\n│\n│" at 47,65 kind dim
text icon2 "▣" at 51,67 kind metric
text metric2 "Context: reused and growing\nacross every retry" at 57,66 kind plain
text separator2 "│\n│\n│\n│\n│" at 100,65 kind dim
text icon3 "⌛" at 104,67 kind metric
text metric3 "Latency: plan + build + verify\nall paid sequentially" at 110,66 kind plain
